{"seq":3,"slug":"team-building","title":"团队构建","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/team-building","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"team-composition","title":"团队组合设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/team-building/team-composition","wordCount":1714,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"onboarding-ramp-up","title":"入职融入与加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/team-building/onboarding-ramp-up","wordCount":1691,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"team-growth-scaling","title":"团队成长与扩展策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-hiring-team-building/team-building/team-growth-scaling","wordCount":1812,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"团队构建\">团队构建</h1><p>候选人接受 offer 只是起点，真正的团队构建从「人到岗」那一刻才开始。本章关注三个关键时间窗口：组建时的人员组合设计、入职后 90 天的融入加速、以及团队从小到大的扩展策略。</p>\n<p>团队组合解决「静态配方」问题——技能互补、经验梯度、多样性；入职融入解决「动态启动」问题——如何让新人从消耗者快速变成产出者；团队扩展解决「规模化」问题——如何在不丧失文化和效率的前提下持续增长。</p>\n<p>三篇内容串联起从个体到团队、从团队到组织的完整路径。</p>\n"}